{"strongs": "H0467", "word": "אֱלִיפֶ֫לֶט", "translit": "e.li.phe.let", "root": "אליפל", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "God is deliverance", "definition": "אֱלִיפֶ֫לֶט ( פָֿ֑לֶט 2Sam 5:16 +) proper name, masculine ( God is deliverance , compare פַּלְטִיאֵל ) \\ \\ a. son of David 2Sam 5:16 ; 1Chr 3:6 ; 1Chr 3:8 ; 1Chr 14:7 = אֶלְפָּ֑לֶט 1Chr 14:5 . \\ \\ b. one of David's heroes 2Sam 23:34 (compare also אֱלִיפָל 1Chr 11:35 ). \\ \\ c. a Benjamite 1Chr 8:39 . \\ \\ d. one of the line of Adonikam Ezra 8:13 . \\ \\ e. of the line of Hashum Ezra 10:33 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB450')\">BDB450</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H467')\">H467</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB449')\">BDB449</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB451')\">BDB451</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֱלִיפֶ֫לֶט</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>פָֿ֑לֶט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 5:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(10,5,16)\">2Sam 5:16</ref> +) <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>God is deliverance</highlight>, compare <bdbheb>פַּלְטִיאֵל</bdbheb>) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> son of David <ref ref=\"2Sam 5:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(10,5,16)\">2Sam 5:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,6)\">1Chr 3:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,8)\">1Chr 3:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 14:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,14,7)\">1Chr 14:7</ref> = <bdbheb>אֶלְפָּ֑לֶט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 14:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,14,5)\">1Chr 14:5</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> one of David's heroes <ref ref=\"2Sam 23:34\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(10,23,34)\">2Sam 23:34</ref> (compare also <bdbheb>אֱלִיפָל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:35\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,35)\">1Chr 11:35</ref>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> a Benjamite <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:39\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,39)\">1Chr 8:39</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> one of the line of Adonikam <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:13\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,13)\">Ezra 8:13</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> of the line of Hashum <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:33\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,33)\">Ezra 10:33</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Sam 5:16", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "1Chr 3:6", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "1Chr 3:8", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "1Chr 14:7", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 14, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "1Chr 14:5", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 14, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "2Sam 23:34", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 23, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "1Chr 11:35", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 35}, {"raw": "1Chr 8:39", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 39}, {"raw": "Ezra 8:13", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 8, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Ezra 10:33", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 10, "verse": 33}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אֱלִיפֶ֫לֶט", "פָֿ֑לֶט", "פַּלְטִיאֵל", "אֶלְפָּ֑לֶט", "אֱלִיפָל"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB450", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}